        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "The learned court below will dispose of his bail application on the same day in light of the direction laid down in Birendra Jha @ Virendra Jha Vs state of Jharkhand reported in {2001(2)JLJR 76].",
